@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

hide footbox
title To get the list of items on direct sale of a given publisher

actor Buyer
participant ":System" as System

Buyer -> System : **1** I want to get a list of items on direct sale of a given publisher
activate System
Buyer <-- System : **2** Which publisher? Choose!
deactivate System
Buyer -> System : **3** publisher
activate System
System --> Buyer : **4** Shows the list of items on direct sale for the publisher
deactivate System

@enduml